Usage: agent-deck openclaw <command> [options]

Commands:
  sync           Sync OpenClaw agents as agent-deck sessions
  bridge         Launch bridge TUI for an agent (runs inside tmux)
  status         Show gateway health and agent summary
  list           List agents from gateway
  send           Send a message to an agent
  help           Show this help

The gateway password is sent in the clear over ws://, so a ws:// gateway_url
must be loopback (127.0.0.0/8, ::1, localhost) or tailnet (100.64.0.0/10,
fd7a:115c:a1e0::/48, *.ts.net). Use wss:// for any other host, or pass
--insecure (or set allow_insecure = true under [openclaw]) to allow it anyway.

Aliases: openclaw, oc
